{"author": "olgasi", "category": "linkedin", "content": {"constraints": [], "context_unit_ids": ["linkedin-posts-2026-04-10-i-was-angry-for-18-md-b558b9bf80:u000001"], "exceptions": [], "goal": null, "kind": "self_report", "prerequisites": [], "steps": [], "summary": {"citations": [{"quote": "Realising you’ve been building something the wrong way for two years is probably a pretty normal Founder experience.", "unit_id": "linkedin-posts-2026-04-10-i-was-angry-for-18-md-b558b9bf80:u000001"}], "text": "The author realized they had been building their YouTube channel the wrong way for two years after their monthly subscribers decreased by 50%, and views were at their lowest."}, "title": "Realizing a Mistake in YouTube Channel Strategy", "topic": "business_strategy"}, "content_hash": "7f182a7e27b0fa965bfd717ae92fa9f085f677937e1e46e295edf65f0205c1bf", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "linkedin-posts-2026-04-10-i-was-angry-for-18-md-b558b9bf80:knowledge:75135abe9f52dc74", "metadata_hash": "c45e19666c223af1a04d02aac33a007dc2c3952bc86588addddd7c1011b2455f", "product": "knowledge", "published_at": "2026-04-10T06:54:28.534000Z", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "post", "source_hash": "284f92a921ecbccaa8e694b0b69829fa24edf23bcb1acc3e628a6170e2b75634", "source_id": "linkedin-posts-2026-04-10-i-was-angry-for-18-md-b558b9bf80", "source_url": "https://www.linkedin.com/posts/olgasi_i-was-angry-for-18-hours-straight-realising-activity-7448262107869167618-4rhM", "title": "Realizing a Mistake in YouTube Channel Strategy", "topic": "business_strategy", "topic_slug": "business_strategy"}
{"author": "olgasi", "category": "linkedin", "content": {"constraints": [], "context_unit_ids": ["linkedin-posts-2026-04-10-i-was-angry-for-18-md-b558b9bf80:u000002"], "exceptions": [], "goal": null, "kind": "self_report", "prerequisites": [], "steps": [], "summary": {"citations": [{"quote": "I’ve invested in a group coaching by the industry expert to become a YouTube Producer.", "unit_id": "linkedin-posts-2026-04-10-i-was-angry-for-18-md-b558b9bf80:u000002"}], "text": "The author decided to invest in group coaching by an industry expert to become a YouTube Producer to fix the issues with their channel."}, "title": "Investing in Expertise for Improvement", "topic": "business_strategy"}, "content_hash": "7f182a7e27b0fa965bfd717ae92fa9f085f677937e1e46e295edf65f0205c1bf", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "linkedin-posts-2026-04-10-i-was-angry-for-18-md-b558b9bf80:knowledge:90552221cfa07b04", "metadata_hash": "c45e19666c223af1a04d02aac33a007dc2c3952bc86588addddd7c1011b2455f", "product": "knowledge", "published_at": "2026-04-10T06:54:28.534000Z", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "post", "source_hash": "284f92a921ecbccaa8e694b0b69829fa24edf23bcb1acc3e628a6170e2b75634", "source_id": "linkedin-posts-2026-04-10-i-was-angry-for-18-md-b558b9bf80", "source_url": "https://www.linkedin.com/posts/olgasi_i-was-angry-for-18-hours-straight-realising-activity-7448262107869167618-4rhM", "title": "Investing in Expertise for Improvement", "topic": "business_strategy", "topic_slug": "business_strategy"}
{"author": "olgasi", "category": "linkedin", "content": {"constraints": [], "context_unit_ids": ["linkedin-posts-2026-04-10-i-was-angry-for-18-md-b558b9bf80:u000002"], "exceptions": [], "goal": null, "kind": "claim", "prerequisites": [], "steps": [], "summary": {"citations": [{"quote": "hidden problems grow exactly like that. They always been there - Current market situation just accelerated them.", "unit_id": "linkedin-posts-2026-04-10-i-was-angry-for-18-md-b558b9bf80:u000002"}], "text": "Hidden problems tend to grow and may be accelerated by the current market situation."}, "title": "Hidden Problems Accelerated by Current Market", "topic": "business_strategy"}, "content_hash": "7f182a7e27b0fa965bfd717ae92fa9f085f677937e1e46e295edf65f0205c1bf", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "linkedin-posts-2026-04-10-i-was-angry-for-18-md-b558b9bf80:knowledge:33e542016e865020", "metadata_hash": "c45e19666c223af1a04d02aac33a007dc2c3952bc86588addddd7c1011b2455f", "product": "knowledge", "published_at": "2026-04-10T06:54:28.534000Z", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "post", "source_hash": "284f92a921ecbccaa8e694b0b69829fa24edf23bcb1acc3e628a6170e2b75634", "source_id": "linkedin-posts-2026-04-10-i-was-angry-for-18-md-b558b9bf80", "source_url": "https://www.linkedin.com/posts/olgasi_i-was-angry-for-18-hours-straight-realising-activity-7448262107869167618-4rhM", "title": "Hidden Problems Accelerated by Current Market", "topic": "business_strategy", "topic_slug": "business_strategy"}
{"author": "olgasi", "category": "linkedin", "content": {"context_unit_ids": ["linkedin-posts-2026-04-10-i-was-angry-for-18-md-b558b9bf80:u000002"], "form": "structure", "observation": {"citations": [{"quote": "At least now I know. At least now I can fix it. At least now I can build it properly.", "unit_id": "linkedin-posts-2026-04-10-i-was-angry-for-18-md-b558b9bf80:u000002"}], "text": "The author uses a series of 'At least now' statements to express gratitude for understanding their errors and having the opportunity to fix them: 'At least now I know. At least now I can fix it. At least now I can build it properly.'"}, "purpose": null, "speaker_id": null, "title": "Expressing Gratitude for Understanding", "topic": "self_reflection"}, "content_hash": "7f182a7e27b0fa965bfd717ae92fa9f085f677937e1e46e295edf65f0205c1bf", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "linkedin-posts-2026-04-10-i-was-angry-for-18-md-b558b9bf80:expression:f2a2cca6d6f8565d", "metadata_hash": "c45e19666c223af1a04d02aac33a007dc2c3952bc86588addddd7c1011b2455f", "product": "expression", "published_at": "2026-04-10T06:54:28.534000Z", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "post", "source_hash": "284f92a921ecbccaa8e694b0b69829fa24edf23bcb1acc3e628a6170e2b75634", "source_id": "linkedin-posts-2026-04-10-i-was-angry-for-18-md-b558b9bf80", "source_url": "https://www.linkedin.com/posts/olgasi_i-was-angry-for-18-hours-straight-realising-activity-7448262107869167618-4rhM", "title": "Expressing Gratitude for Understanding", "topic": "self_reflection", "topic_slug": "self_reflection"}
